[Title: Triangle Dreamer] [Text: Lyrics & Music: Kenichi Maeyamada]

133
00:24:53,652 --> 00:25:04,285
Day by day 日に日に募るの乙女心
Day by day, day by day, a maiden's heart grows stronger—

134
